    "formTitle": "<h1><strong>Application for Graduate Student Leave</strong></h1><p></p>",
    "formDescription": "<p><strong><em>TEST ROUTING VERSION</em></strong></p><p></p><p>WSU graduate students must enroll each semester (excluding summer) unless they are granted an official leave of absence. Students may request leave from their graduate program using this form.</p><p></p><p>The submission deadline for this request is the 30th day of class in the semester you begin leave.</p><p></p><p><strong>INSTRUCTIONS:</strong></p><ul><li><p>       1. Please read the form's questions and answer them carefully. Once you have completed all fields, click          \"Submit\" at the bottom.</p></li><li><p>      2. You will receive an email from the WSU Graduate School with instructions to review and approve this request.</p></li><li><p>      3. After approval, your academic coordinator will receive the completed PDF form. They will review the   document, obtain approval from a graduate program signature authority, and submit this request to the Graduate School.</p></li></ul><p></p><p>Students who do not enroll and are not on official leave must submit a Request for Re-enrollment and pay a re-enrollment fee to resume their studies. Missing three consecutive required semesters will result in discontinuation from the graduate program.</p><p></p><p><strong>QUESTIONS:</strong></p><p><u>For questions about the leave process</u>, contact the Graduate School at (509) 335-1446 or at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-[color:var(--wsu-crimson)] underline cursor-pointer\" href=\"mailto:gradschool@wsu.edu\">gradschool@wsu.edu</a>.</p><p></p><p><u>For questions about financial impacts related to employment</u>, including salary, benefits, and student health insurance, contact the Graduate School's Finance Team at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-[color:var(--wsu-crimson)] underline cursor-pointer\" href=\"mailto:gs.finance@wsu.edu\">gs.finance@wsu.edu</a>.</p>",
    "allowedDomains": [
      "wsu.edu"
    ],
    "attachmentsEnabled": false
  },
